Serves the dashboard, durable jobs and analytics history for trusted repositories

Usage: leptoskit console serve [OPTIONS] --project <PROJECT>

Options:
      --project <PROJECT>  
      --data <DATA>        
      --bind <BIND>        [default: 127.0.0.1:4700]
      --url <URL>          Public HTTPS origin, or localhost HTTP for local use [default: http://localhost:4700]
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
